<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>拉脱维亚支持波罗的海航空担保寻找投资者</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latvia-backs-air-baltic-guarantee-as-it-searches-for-investor</link><description>拉脱维亚议会支持为国有波罗的海航空公司提供 1.75 亿欧元（1.92 亿美元）的担保，以解锁其《破产法》第 11 章重组中的下一阶段融资，因为这家陷入困境的航空公司下个月可能会耗尽资金。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latvia-backs-air-baltic-guarantee-as-it-searches-for-investor'&gt;拉脱维亚支持波罗的海航空担保寻找投资者&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latvia Backs Air Baltic Guarantee as it Searches for Investor&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latvia-backs-air-baltic-guarantee-as-it-searches-for-investor</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:03:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>套利平仓导致墨西哥比索出现 2021 年以来最严重连跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind</link><description>随着投资者纷纷转向避险资产以及流行的套利交易瓦解，墨西哥比索正面临五年来最长的连续下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind'&gt;套利平仓导致墨西哥比索出现 2021 年以来最严重连跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mexican Peso Sees Worst Losing Streak Since 2021 on Carry Unwind&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/mexican-peso-sees-worst-losing-streak-since-2021-on-carry-unwind</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:07:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>BCG 探讨首席执行官彻夜难眠的原因</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bcg-on-what-s-keeping-ceos-up-at-night-video</link><description>从人工智能和员工信任到政治不确定性和增长压力，波士顿咨询集团的一项新调查揭示了商业领袖面临的压力。 BCG 欧洲、中东和非洲地区执行合伙人 Matthias Tauber 在彭博市场上与 Stephen Carroll 讨论了首席执行官们彻夜难眠的原因。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bcg-on-what-s-keeping-ceos-up-at-night-video'&gt;BCG 探讨首席执行官彻夜难眠的原因&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BCG on What’s Keeping CEOs Up at Night&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bcg-on-what-s-keeping-ceos-up-at-night-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:20:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>BBVA 考虑使用 SRT 对冲约 5 亿美元的数据中心贷款</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans</link><description>BBVA SA 正在考虑一项交易，以减轻约 5 亿欧元（5.47 亿美元）数据中心贷款的风险，世界各地的银行都在探索多种方法来对冲人工智能相关基础设施的风险。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans'&gt;BBVA 考虑使用 SRT 对冲约 5 亿美元的数据中心贷款&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BBVA Eyes Hedge for About $500 million in Data Center Loans&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/bbva-weighs-srt-to-hedge-about-500-million-of-data-center-loans</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:27:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英国因寒流而面临电力供应紧张的第三天</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-faces-third-day-of-strained-electricity-supplies-on-cold-snap</link><description>英国周四再次面临电力供应紧张，寒流提振需求，导致电力供应紧张局面延续。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-faces-third-day-of-strained-electricity-supplies-on-cold-snap'&gt;英国因寒流而面临电力供应紧张的第三天&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Europe Power Prices Surge as UK Issues Another Margin Warning&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/uk-faces-third-day-of-strained-electricity-supplies-on-cold-snap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 07:05:06 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>